{"i":0,"text":"Before you can head off, another pirate emerges from the building. It's your hated rival, Captain Neckbeard, and he's holding a piece of paper that looks suspiciously like your map.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.512,"end":12.128,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":30},"large":{"start":0.512,"end":12.128,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":30},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"\"Ahoy there! What a coincidence it be that before you took that map I made this here copy.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":12.832,"end":20.16,"frac":0.833,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":18},"large":{"start":12.832,"end":19.98,"frac":0.944,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":18},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"Isn’t that just like Captain Neckbeard? Always doing things like naming his ship The Sea Dog , and is constantly trying to poach your maps and crew.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":20.352,"end":28.96,"frac":0.962,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":26},"large":{"start":20.352,"end":28.62,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":26,"words":26},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"Time to make a choice!","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":29.856,"end":31.264,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":5},"large":{"start":29.856,"end":31.264,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":5},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[{"start":31.62,"end":33.52,"words":7,"text":"what witty retort do you throw back"}],"large":[{"start":31.12,"end":33.42,"words":7,"text":"what witty retort do you throw back"}]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92820bc200_PC%20JM1_no_shadow.png"}